  "notes": [
    "Maximums and minimums are per 1,000 points unless otherwise stated.",
    "A Prussian Infantry Brigade Commander has no Staff Rating 7 option in this list — the minimum is Staff Rating 8.",
    "Prussian Staff System: a brigade commander may purchase a subordinate commander for +10 points, who issues orders using the brigade commander's Staff Rating.",
    "Angriffskolonne (Assault Column) and Zug Column (Column of Companies) represent Prussian attack and manoeuvre formations.",
    "'No prisoners! No pity!': against a French army, all Prussian infantry and cavalry count as Tough Fighters.",
    "This builder omits the book's many point-modifier upgrades/downgrades (Valiant upgrade, Large battalions, Veteran status, etc.) — apply these manually per the book when finalising a list.",
    "Named commanders have no official points cost in this supplement — priced here at the generic Divisional Commander cost for their Staff Rating; adjust freely."
  ]
